  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the dining room near the waiter station, Max stages an elaborate medical emergency to get waitress Sasha's attention. Pretending to suffer from acute appendicitis, he draws her close before surprising her with cinema tickets. Let's listen to their playful encounter in Russian.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Саша, привет! Как дела?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Привет, поварёнок! Всё нормально.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ой, ай! Как больно!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Что с тобой случилось?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "У меня сильно колет в боку.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "С какой именно стороны?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вот здесь, с правой стороны.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "С правой? Это может быть аппендицит!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Давай я срочно вызову скорую?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Нет, не надо никакой скорой!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Смотри, у меня два билета!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Что? Ты просто придурок, Макс!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Пойдёшь со мной вечером в кино?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Ладно, пойдём! До вечера, артист.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's examine the dialogue sentence by sentence. Notice the symptoms of distress, medical emergency phrasing, and casual conversational invitations.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Саша, привет! Как дела?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sasha, hi! How are things?' Max greets Sasha and asks how she is doing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Привет, поварёнок! Всё нормально.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hi, little cook! Everything is normal.' Sasha says hello back. She calls him a little cook in a friendly way.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ой, ай! Как больно!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, ow! How painful!' Max fakes stomach pain again. He cries out in fake agony.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Что с тобой случилось?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened to you?' Sasha asks what is wrong with him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "У меня сильно колет в боку.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have a sharp pain in my side.' Max complains about a sharp stabbing pain in his side.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "С какой именно стороны?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On which side exactly?' Sasha wants to know exactly which side hurts.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вот здесь, с правой стороны.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right here, on the right side.' Max points out that the pain is on his right side.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "С правой? Это может быть аппендицит!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On the right? That could be appendicitis!' Sasha gets worried because right side pain could mean appendicitis.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Давай я срочно вызову скорую?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Shall I urgently call an ambulance?' Sasha offers to call for medical help right away. The word for ambulance literally means fast.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Нет, не надо никакой скорой!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, no need for any ambulance!' Max quickly stops her from calling anyone.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Смотри, у меня два билета!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look, I have two tickets!' Max reveals his trick and shows her the movie tickets instead.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Что? Ты просто придурок, Макс!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? You are just a jerk, Max!' Sasha is shocked and calls him a jerk for the stupid joke.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Пойдёшь со мной вечером в кино?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Will you go to the movies with me tonight?' Max asks her if she will join him for a movie later.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Ладно, пойдём! До вечера, артист.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, let's go! See you tonight, actor.' Sasha agrees to go. She calls him an actor because of his fake pain. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
