      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sasha heads off to her tables with a laugh while Max celebrates the success of his clever theatrical ploy. Great work practicing conversational Russian! Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'appendicitis' and 'performer' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
